      "id": "1",
      "title": "Aesthetic Glass Arch Canopy Office",
      "description": "This cutting-edge commercial office building integrates a monumental concrete and glass sweeping arch canopy. Inspired by biological shapes, the architecture blends massive transparent structural glass walls with deep concrete overhangs to manage direct sunlight in hot climates. Inside, multi-floor glass atriums connect modern working areas with nature.",
