      "id": "2",
      "title": "Curved Steel Mesh Canopy Hall",
      "description": "Designed for hosting large community gatherings and public events, this multi-purpose facility features a structural curved steel mesh envelope that flows down from the main roof deck. This mesh structure filters sunlight, providing a naturally ventilated, shaded courtyard space while reducing the thermal load on the internal glass-walled exhibition halls.",
